@host = http://localhost:5080

### 1. Empty channel list -> 204
GET {{host}}/api/channels

### 2. Create ACTIVE channel. Copy id from response.
POST {{host}}/api/channels
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "command": "new",
  "name": "demo",
  "state": "ACTIVE",
  "description": "Demo channel"
}

### Put copied GUID here
@id = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### 3. Get channel -> 200
GET {{host}}/api/channels/{{id}}

### 4. WARNING: open already ACTIVE channel
PUT {{host}}/api/channels
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "command": "open",
  "id": "{{id}}"
}

### 5. First enqueue fills bounded queue
POST {{host}}/api/queue
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "command": "enqueue",
  "id": "{{id}}",
  "data": "{\"message\":\"first\"}"
}

### 6. WARNING: second enqueue waits WaitEnqueue seconds, then 408
POST {{host}}/api/queue
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "command": "enqueue",
  "id": "{{id}}",
  "data": "{\"message\":\"second\"}"
}

### 7. Peek -> first item remains
POST {{host}}/api/queue
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "command": "peek",
  "id": "{{id}}"
}

### 8. Dequeue -> removes first item
POST {{host}}/api/queue
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "command": "dequeue",
  "id": "{{id}}"
}

### 9. ERROR: nonexistent channel -> 404
GET {{host}}/api/channels/11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111
